                                "example_id": "76ac5baa-3d88-41c9-8a39-b9a81f3fb676",
                                "sense_id": "10376d86-1f00-36c8-81cf-960369911816",
                                "text": "He strives for husbandly allure in slow-motion ballads: “Love You Gently” and the role-reversing “Trading Places,” in which he calls for her to be the aggressive one and offers to make breakfast the next morning."
                            },
                            {
